==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|i|n}}

===Etymology===
From the same root as {{term|ihminen|lang=fi}}, which was spelled ''inhiminen'' in the 16th century.<ref>{{R:Hakkinen 2004}}</ref> Compare {{term|inehmo}}.

